CHGame bootloader with the SD game menu
Copyright 2026 bateske

Based on CH32SerialBoot v0.2.4 (MIT, see LICENSE). Its third-party
components are listed in THIRD-PARTY.md.

The SD game menu adds code from two other parts of CHCasino, both MIT:

- src/sd.c and src/fat.c are C ports of CHSd 1.0.0
  (platform/libraries/CHSd). Its NOTICE says the SPI-mode block driver and
  the FAT reader are HypeRunner's clean-room code (MIT), written from the SD
  Physical Layer Simplified Specification, the Microsoft FAT specification,
  the MBR layout and the CH32X035 reference manual, with no code from any
  other SD or FAT library.

- The ST7735 panel set-up values in src/lcd.c come from CHGfx 1.3.0
  (platform/libraries/CHGfx, MIT).

- src/font5x7.h is CHGfx 1.3.0's src/CHGfx_font.h, unchanged. CHGfx's
  notice for it reads:

